OL,3,AJudgement day for Kenya pastor accused
OL,4,Aof ordering parents to starve their
OL,5,Achildren to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Kenyan judge has started to deliver a
OL,8,Fverdict in a mass murder case involving
OL,9,Fdoomsday preacher Paul Mackenzie.
OL,11,FMackenzie and 29 of his followers are
OL,12,Fbeing charged with the murder of 191
OL,13,Fpeople, all but one of them children.
OL,15,FHis cult is alleged to have forced
OL,16,Fchildren to starve to death so that
OL,17,Fthey could "meet Jesus". His doomsday
OL,18,Fdoctrine said that education was
OL,19,Fforbidden and modern medicine was
OL,20,Fconsidered "evil".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
